{"id":"1291f8efcdef81cf","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-yoneda-lemma.md","title":"Theorem — Yoneda Lemma","display":"Theorem — Yoneda Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-yoneda-lemma","aliases":["14-thm-yoneda-lemma"],"display":"Theorem — Yoneda Lemma","depends_on":["[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-category]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-yoneda-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-yoneda-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Yoneda Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (presheaf, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})\">\\(\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})\\)</span> (Yoneda embedding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsNatural}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsNatural}\\)</span> (natural-transformation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}\\)</span> (object-set operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}\">\\(\\mathrm{id}\\)</span> (identity assignment, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall s\\in F(A)\\;\\exists!\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\alpha,\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}(A),F)\\land\\alpha_A(\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(A))=s\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall s\\in F(A)\\;\\exists!\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\alpha,\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}(A),F)\\land\\alpha_A(\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(A))=s\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.1，Yoneda 对应公式 (6)，印刷页 26；DjVu 第 19 图页。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in F(A)\">\\(s\\in F(A)\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_X(h)=F(h)(s)\">\\(\\alpha_X(h)=F(h)(s)\\)</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(g)F(h)=F(hg)\">\\(F(g)F(h)=F(hg)\\)</span> 得自然性。反之任何自然变换满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_X(h)=F(h)(\\alpha_A(1_A))\">\\(\\alpha_X(h)=F(h)(\\alpha_A(1_A))\\)</span>，所以恒等处的值唯一决定所有分量。此构造与求值互逆，完成存在性与唯一性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)$ (presheaf, see [[14-df-presheaf-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\m